# edits the testers reported (docs/feedback-2026-10-21.md): clearing the scene playing (it hands over to the nearest
# other scene, or the only one starts again plain); song slots inserted and deleted while the song plays (the slot
# playing keeps playing); CLEAR LOCKS (undone; a kit's tunes stay) and PASTE (with the locks; never across kinds)
wait 300
bpm 120
# the scene playing cleared: scene 2 goes, scene 1 plays
scenedef 2 2
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect scene 2
expect used 3
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
key w1 up
tap SEL
wait 40
expect used 1
expect scene 1
# the only scene cleared: it stays, plain
scenedef 1 3
scenemute 1 x
key w0 down
wait 1100
key w0 up
tap SEL
wait 40
expect used 1
expect scene 1
expect mute 0
# the song: S1 S2 S3, a bar each; slot 2 playing, a slot added before it (after slot 1): slot 2 now third, and plays on
scenedef 2 2
scenedef 3 3
song 1:1 2:1 3:1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
turn K1 -5
tap PLAY
bars 1.25
expect songpos 2
expect scene 2
tapkey w2
wait 40
expect songpos 3
expect scene 2
bars 1
expect songpos 4
expect scene 3
# slot 4 playing (S3), slot 4 deleted: the slot in its place next (none: back to slot 1)
turn K1 -5
turn K1 3
tap SEL
turn SELECT 6
shot song_del.png
tap SEL
wait 40
bars 1
expect songpos 1
expect scene 1
# the song is S1 S3 S2: slot 1 playing, deleted: S3 (now slot 1) next, then S2
turn K1 -5
tap SEL
turn SELECT 6
tap SEL
wait 40
expect scene 1
bars 1
expect songpos 1
expect scene 3
bars 1
expect songpos 2
expect scene 2
tap PLAY
# CLEAR LOCKS undone; PASTE brings the locks; a synth's pattern is not pasted on a kit
tap HOME
step 2 1 1 60 100
lock 2 1 1 e1 30
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap SEQ
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
expect lane 2 1 e1 0
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect lane 2 1 e1 1
tap SEL
turn SELECT 3
tap SEL
turn K1 1
wait 40
tap SEL
turn SELECT 4
shot paste_list.png
tap SEL
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect lane 2 2 e1 1
turn ALGO -1
expect trk 1
tap SEL
turn SELECT 4
tap SEL
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 0
